  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>OperatorNote</name>
    <x>42</x>
    <y>965</y>
    <width>1450</width>
    <height>42</height>
    <text>Overview is intentionally read-only. Open each detail page once, then use its existing Phoebus tab to switch views and preserve the live trend buffer. Hardware controls remain subject to Genesis write gates and target safety interlocks.</text>
